          "title": "Og Image Url",
          "description": "Absolute, directly-fetchable URL for the post's OG image.\n\n``og_image_path`` is a raw storage key (``og_images/<file>``)\nkept for backwards compatibility; it stops being resolvable\nunder ``/static/`` once the og_images bucket moves to object\nstorage (THECOLONYC-124 #6). New consumers should use this\nfield. Function-local import: the resolver lives in the OG\nservice module, which pulls PIL/OpenAI at import time —\nschemas must stay light.",
          "readOnly": true
        },
        "accepting_submissions": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "boolean"
